OL,3,GNEWSAMinor injuries unit moves to new
OL,4,Alocation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA minor injuries unit (MIU) in Essex is
OL,7,Fto move to Thurrock Community Hospital
OL,8,Fon Monday.
OL,10,FThe new site will be located at the
OL,11,FJohn Tallack Centre in Long Lane,
OL,12,FGrays, a mile and a half away from the
OL,13,Fformer site in Orsett, and will open at
OL,14,F10:00.
OL,16,FPatients with a minor injury up until
OL,17,Fthat point should contact NHS 111,
OL,18,Fvisit their pharmacist or go to the
OL,19,FBasildon Hospital emergency department,
OL,20,Fthe Essex integrated care board said.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
