OL,3,GNEWSAMinor injuries unit moves to new
OL,4,Alocation
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Matt Sweeting from the board told
OL,7,FBBC Essex that the move to the new
OL,8,Funit, which cost #1m to upgrade, "would
OL,9,Fmake services better".
